  "releaseNotes": "v8.0.0\n- New Maps module (MapsHelper):\n  - Geocode: address to coordinates (Geocoding API).\n  - ReverseGeocode: coordinates to address (Geocoding API).\n  - CalculateDistance: road distance and travel duration between two addresses or two coordinate sets, powered by the Google Routes API (computeRouteMatrix). Supports TravelMode (Driving/Walking/Bicycling/Transit) and UnitSystem (Metric/Imperial).\n  - CalculateStraightLineDistance: local great-circle (Haversine) distance, no API call.\n  - Async variants (net9 / netstandard2.1+).\n- Added NuGet README (package documentation).\nNote: the Maps helpers require the Geocoding API and the Routes API to be enabled on your Google Cloud project.",
